><div class="brix---divider-40px"></div><div class="brix---mg-bottom-40px-10"><div class="w-layout-grid brix---grid-1-column-gap-row-16px-3"><div class="brix---icon-list-item-wrapper-3"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf7b5/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf8cf_check_secondary_light.svg" class="brix---icon-list-3"/><div class="brix---color-neutral-872"><div class="brix---text-200-list-bold-2">Fachliche Tiefe</div></div></div><div class="brix---icon-list-item-wrapper-3"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf7b5/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf8cf_check_secondary_light.svg" class="brix---icon-list-3"/><div class="brix---color-neutral-872"><div class="brix---text-200-list-bold-2">Flexibilität</div></div></div><div class="brix---icon-list-item-wrapper-3"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf7b5/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf8cf_check_secondary_light.svg" class="brix---icon-list-3"/><div class="brix---color-neutral-872"><div class="brix---text-200-list-bold-2">Produktivitäts-Boost</div></div></div><div class="brix---icon-list-item-wrapper-3"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf7b5/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf8cf_check_secondary_light.svg" class="brix---icon-list-3"/><div class="brix---color-neutral-872"><div class="brix---text-200-list-bold-2">Qualitätssteigerung</div></div></div></div></div><a href="/contact" class="brix---btn-primary-white-full-width w-button">Dein Team erweitern</a></div></div><div class="brix---card-3"><div class="brix---pricing-content-v2"><div class="brix---mg-bottom-32px-10"><div class="brix---color-neutral-870"><h3 class="brix---heading-h3-size-6">Managed Team-Erweiterung</h3></div><div class="brix---color-neutral-871"><p class="brix---paragraph-default-13">Für Projekte, die mehr Kapazität brauchen: Wir stellen das Team zusammen, übernehmen die Koordination und liefern gegen deine Roadmap. Für CTOs, die ein Ergebnis wollen.</p></div></div><div class="brix---divider-40px"></div><div class="brix---mg-bottom-40px-10"><div class="w-layout-grid brix---grid-1-column-gap-row-16px-3"><div class="brix---icon-list-item-wrapper-3"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf7b5/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf8cc_68c1461772fb0912e50f7055_c39020b51637b50e56bcb8f2541780d4_check-icon-brix-templates.svg" class="brix---icon-list-3"/><div class="brix---color-neutral-870"><div class="brix---text-200-list-bold-2">Ganzheitlicher Ansatz </div></div></div><div class="brix---icon-list-item-wrapper-3"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf7b5/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf8cc_68c1461772fb0912e50f7055_c39020b51637b50e56bcb8f2541780d4_check-icon-brix-templates.svg" class="brix---icon-list-3"/><div class="brix---color-neutral-870"><div class="brix---text-200-list-bold-2">Ressourcenschonend</div></div></div><div class="brix---icon-list-item-wrapper-3"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf7b5/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf8cc_68c1461772fb0912e50f7055_c39020b51637b50e56bcb8f2541780d4_check-icon-brix-templates.svg" class="brix---icon-list-3"/><div class="brix---color-neutral-870"><div class="brix---text-200-list-bold-2">Verantwortungsübernahme</div></div></div><div class="brix---icon-list-item-wrapper-3"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf7b5/69c2a2f4e8da9f606eeaf8cc_68c1461772fb0912e50f7055_c39020b51637b50e56bcb8f2541780d4_check-icon-brix-templates.svg" class="brix---icon-list-3"/><div class="brix---color-neutral-870"><div class="brix---text-200-list-bold-2">Langfristige Skalierung</div></div></div></div></div><a href="/contact" class="brix---btn-primary-full-width-2 w-button">Experten Team buchen</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="brix---section-logo-strip-v6-2"><h2 class="brix---heading-h1-size-9">Was uns unterscheidet</h2><section><h2 class="heading-17"><strong>Nicht einfach mehr Entwickler. AI-nativer Multiplikator für dein Team.</strong></h2><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid"><div class="brix---card-link-content-left"><div class="brix---subtitle-7"><strong>AI-NATIVE DEVELOPMENT</strong></div><h3 class="brix---heading-h3-size-6"><strong>Agentic Coding: 3–5x Output</strong></h3><p class="brix---paragraph-default-13">Claude Code, Cursor, Codex und Agentic Coding sind für unsere Entwickler Standard. Dadurch liefern wir Features, Automatisierungen und Software-Projekte in Tagen statt Wochen.</p></div><div class="brix---card-link-content-left"><div class="brix---subtitle-7"><strong>Mehr als Code</strong></div><h3 class="brix---heading-h3-size-6"><strong>Beratung und Projekterfahrung inklusive </strong></h3><p class="brix---paragraph-default-13">Wir bringen Erfahrung aus Dutzenden Projekten mit. Als CTO bekommst du einen Partner, der Architektur, Prozesse und Teamstrukturen wirklich versteht.</p></div><div class="brix---card-link-content-left"><div class="brix---subtitle-7"><strong>DEUTSCHE QUALITÄT, KEIN OVERHEAD</strong></div><h3 class="brix---heading-h3-size-6"><strong>Sofort produktiv.<br/>Keine Kompromisse.</strong></h3><p class="brix---paragraph-default-13">Gleiche Zeitzone, keine Sprachbarriere, DSGVO-konform by default. Unsere Entwickler integrieren sich ab Tag 1 in deinen Workflow — ohne Anlaufzeit, mit Ownership-Mentalität.</p></div><div class="brix---card-link-content-left"><div class="brix---subtitle-7"><strong>AI-FIRST TRANSFORMATION</strong></div><h3 class="brix---heading-h3-size-6"><strong>Nachhaltiger Know-how-Transfer</strong></h3><p class="brix---paragraph-default-13">Wir integrieren bewährte Agentic-Coding-Workflows direkt in dein Team. Von Architektur und Code Reviews bis CI/CD und Testautomatisierung – egal ob iOS, Android, Flutter, Backend, DevOps oder Cloud.</p></div></div></div></section></div><div class="brix---section"><div class="brix---container-default w-container"><div class="brix---inner-container-1068px-ce